nfs-ganesha (15.10-1+ezgh1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Upstream NFS-Ganesha V15.10 (38f542cd5ef8) with its bundled ntirpc, for
    EZGH Files gateways: RPC-with-TLS (OpenSSL, kTLS), per-export QoS,
    FSAL_CEPH, rados_cluster recovery and RADOS URLs, built against upstream
    Ceph 20.2.4 client libraries. NFSv4 only: no NFSv3, NLM, RQUOTA or 9P.

